msgstr "El fitxer està trencat"

#. 'client_secret' is a technical term and should not be translated
msgid ""
"Generate a new client_secret. The old secret will become invalid immediately."
msgstr ""
"Genera un nou client_secret. El secret antic esdevindrà invàlid "
"immediatament."

msgid "Get email address"
msgstr "Obtén l'adreça de correu electrònic"

msgid "Get the amount of Pixels placed and ranking"
msgstr "Obtén la quantitat de Píxels col·locats i la classificació"

msgid ""
"Have fun and don't hesitate to contact us if you encounter any problems :)"
msgstr ""
"Diverteix-te i no dubtis de contactar amb nosaltres si tens cap problema :)"

msgid "Hello"
msgstr "Hola"

#, javascript-format
msgid "Hello ${ email }, you can set your new password here:"
msgstr "Hola ${ email }, pots establir la teva contrasenya nova aquí:"

#, javascript-format
msgid "Hello ${ name }"
msgstr "Hola ${ name }"

msgid ""
"If this was you, please ignore this email. If it wasn't you, please go to <a "
"href=\"https://pixelplanet.fun\">pixelplanet.fun</a> and log-out any session "
"that you are unaware of under \"Login Methods\" in the User Area and change "
"your password."
msgstr ""
"Si has estat tu, ignora aquest correu. Si no has estat tu, ves a <a "
"href=\"https://pixelplanet.fun\">pixelplanet.fun</a> i tanca qualsevol "
"sessió que desconeguis a \"Mètodes d'inici de sessió\" a l'Àrea d'Usuari i "
"canvia la contrasenya."

#, javascript-format
msgid ""
"If you did not request this mail, please just ignore it (the ip that "
"requested this mail was ${ ip })."
msgstr ""
"Si no has sol·licitat aquest correu electrònic, si us plau ignora'l (la IP "
"que va sol·licitar aquest correu era ${ ip })."

